abstract: >-
  A course of thirteen Jupyter notebooks that teaches DSPy 3.x layer by layer
  through a PyTorch analogy: a multi-hop QA program over a hand-built fictional
  micro-world (Aldervane), a metric, and then BootstrapFewShot, MIPROv2, GEPA,
  ReAct, tracing with MLflow and Phoenix, and a HotPotQA capstone.
